Error [E0120]: `m` was not moved here, so its contents cannot be taken apart
  --> tests/ui/pattern_escaped_borrow.jet:12:8
    |
 12 |     if m == {
    |        ^
 Why: `m` grants read-only access to `Msg`, so its non-copyable parts cannot be taken apart with the move marker `^`
 Fix: Change the parameter to `m: ^Msg` with the move marker `^`, or inspect it without binding its contents
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
